  {
   "key": "about_zh",
   "value": "小草颂（LitleGras Music Club, LGM）成立于 2000 年，是理大工程系分院的原创音乐团体。“小草”寓意力量虽小，也努力朝音乐梦成长。我们希望成为全马大专院校中出色的音乐创作团体，为观众带来视听享受，也为社员提供完整、有收获的学习环境，培养有能力、有责任感的音乐人。",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "about_en",
   "value": "LitleGras Music Club (LGM) was founded in 2000 at the USM Engineering Campus. We aspire to be one of the great music creation organizations among Malaysia's colleges and universities, giving audiences an impressive audio-visual experience and providing a comprehensive, rewarding learning environment for skilled and responsible musicians.",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "mission_zh",
   "value": "持续制作高质量演出，让小草颂成为全马大专院校中享有声誉的音乐团体。",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "mission_en",
   "value": "Continuously produce high-quality performances, so that LitleGras Music Club is known as a prestigious music club throughout the colleges in Malaysia.",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "vision_zh",
   "value": "以出色的演出带给观众视觉与听觉的享受|提供完整、良好的学习环境，培养有能力、有责任感的音乐人",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "vision_en",
   "value": "Impress audiences through outstanding performances that are an aural and visual delight|Develop skilled and responsible musicians through an extensive and conducive learning environment",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
   "key": "annual_activities_zh",
   "value": "年度音乐创作演绎会|小型音乐会|北马作曲人协会金锋奖创作歌曲观摩赛|年度歌唱比赛（小草新歌声）|PBT Night、Pesta Budaya 4.0 等校内演出|迎新夜|音乐营|每周音乐课",
   "说明": ""
  },
  {
